        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/eada6e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-24T16:44:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If a cards gets played at End of Turn and it has an End of Turn effect, does that effect take place or does it skip?</p><p>For example:&nbsp; At the End of the Villain Turn, the Operative pulls an Underboss from the deck.&nbsp; That Underboss has the ability to pull a Thug from the trash.&nbsp; Does the Thug get pulled or would it wait for the End of the *next* villain turn?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:53.601Z",
