        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-24T18:24:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since card effects at start or end of turn happen in the order the cards enter play.</p><p>So if a card enters play during the Start or End of turn it is the last card in order and takes its turn in the proper order.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
