        "created_at": "2013-12-24T20:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes. That’s why some cards say you can only flip once this way a turn.</p>\n<p>They go just order. If the text is no longer present, because it flipped, it does not apply. Similar to destroying something before it can act or complete an action.</p>",
